<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST-H&amp;M 9-mth pre-tax profit 853 mln skr.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-H&amp;M 9-mth pre-tax profit 853 mln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish clothing retailer Hennes &amp; Mauritz is expected to post a pre-tax profit of 853 million crowns for the nine months from December 1, 1995, a Reuters poll of seven analysts found on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The result is due to be released on September 26.</p>
<p>For the 12 months to November 30, 1996, the average of analysts' forecasts showed expectations of a pre-tax profit of 1.62 billion crowns.</p>
<p>In the 1994/95 financial year H&amp;M posted a pre-tax profit of 1.32 billion crowns.</p>
<p>				   AVERAGE	MEAN	   RANGE</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit, 9 mth	 853	  850	750 - 915</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit, 95/96     1,624	1,622    1,585 - 1,701</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1008</p>
